{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"MayDay.SnowApp","latestVersion":"0.5.15","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.c5f8102d.png","priority":1,"sha256":"c5f8102d21fc3991df8866713bedff81c50b435cb53c8efe9adef80a0e2389a4","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"copyright":"Copyright (c) 2026 MayMay","description":"Developer-focused desktop workspace that integrates AI chat, terminal emulation, SSH remote management, Git tooling, and a built-in browser panel.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Getting Started","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/blob/main/docs/en/1-getting-started.md"},{"DocumentLabel":"Documentation","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/blob/main/docs/README.md"}],"license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"copyright":"Copyright (c) 2026 MayMay","description":"Developer-focused desktop workspace that integrates AI chat, terminal emulation, SSH remote management, Git tooling, and a built-in browser panel.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Getting Started","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/blob/main/docs/en/1-getting-started.md"},{"DocumentLabel":"Documentation","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/blob/main/docs/README.md"}],"license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Snow App is a developer-focused desktop application that integrates AI-powered chat, terminal emulation, SSH remote management, Git tooling, and a built-in browser panel into a single unified workspace. It leverages a Rust native module for performance-critical operations such as SQLite storage, AI streaming, file watching, and HTTP requests. Additional capabilities include MCP support, AI image generation, a skills system, hooks, sub-agents, codebase semantic search, and AI-driven terminal sessions.","name":"Snow App","packageUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app","publisher":"MayDay","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/releases/tag/v0.2.3","tags":["ai","chat","codex","git","mcp","ssh","terminal"]},"zh-CN":{"copyright":"版权所有 (c) 2026 MayMay","description":"面向开发者的桌面应用，将 AI 对话、终端模拟、SSH 远程管理、Git 工具和内置浏览器面板整合到统一的工作空间中。","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"快速开始","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/blob/main/docs/zh-CN/1-快速开始.md"},{"DocumentLabel":"文档","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/blob/main/docs/README.md"}],"locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Snow App 是一款面向开发者的桌面应用，将 AI 对话、终端模拟、SSH 远程管理、Git 工具和内置浏览器面板整合到统一的工作空间中。它通过 Rust 原生模块处理性能关键型操作，包括 SQLite 存储、AI 流式传输、文件监控和 HTTP 请求。此外还支持 MCP 集成、AI 图像生成、技能系统、Hooks、子代理、代码库语义搜索与 AI 驱动的终端会话。","releaseNotes":"新功能\n- 提交信息生成提示：提交框中已有的文字会作为提示传给 AI 生成提交信息（可指定语言、语气或作为草稿），桌面与手机端均支持。\n- 插件图标统一：插件图标支持 lucide:名称、http(s) 与 data:image 地址；OAuth 服务商图标缺失时回退到插件列表图标，市场条目从仓库 plugin.json 读取图标（缓存 30 天，离线也能显示）。\n改进\n- 工具插件在项目内默认停用，需显式启用后才注入工具与加载 Skills；插件详情新增可折叠的工具与 Skills 清单。\n- 记忆工具合并为统一的 memory-manage，通过 action 区分操作。\n- 归档列表的表头（搜索与多选工具栏）固定在滚动区域之外。\n- 手机 Git 面板移除左右滑动翻页，改为点击切换。\n修复\n- 弹窗内按 Esc 不再触发中断会话快捷键，且只关闭最上层弹窗。\n- 插件工具卡片不再回退为未本地化的工具名。","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/blob/HEAD/RELEASE_NOTES_ZH.md#v0515","tags":["ai","codex","git","mcp","ssh","终端","聊天"]}},"longDescription":"Snow App is a developer-focused desktop application that integrates AI-powered chat, terminal emulation, SSH remote management, Git tooling, and a built-in browser panel into a single unified workspace. It leverages a Rust native module for performance-critical operations such as SQLite storage, AI streaming, file watching, and HTTP requests. Additional capabilities include MCP support, AI image generation, a skills system, hooks, sub-agents, codebase semantic search, and AI-driven 